{{ 'catalogue.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- comment -%}
  Alterpop — Line Page "BY CHARACTER / BY UNIVERSE" toggle (wireframe 9b / p42).
  A Line crosses characters and franchises, so the grid can be grouped by
  either. Same discipline as the Character Page cuts: the UI is built whole,
  the grouping REORGANISES the grid (never gates it), and — because Character
  and Universe are BLOCKED — clicking a toggle shows a marked empty state
  instead of grouped sections. `line-group-by.js` wires the reorder to
  `data-character` / `data-universe` on the grid items; inert until the
  fields exist. NO inference.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="ap-groupby" aria-label="{{ 'sections.catalogue.group_by' | t }}">
  <div class="ap-groupby__inner page-width">
    <div class="ap-groupby__toggles" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'sections.catalogue.group_by' | t }}">
      <button type="button" class="ap-groupby__toggle type-label" data-group="character" aria-pressed="false">
        {{ 'sections.catalogue.group_character' | t }}
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="ap-groupby__toggle type-label" data-group="universe" aria-pressed="false">
        {{ 'sections.catalogue.group_universe' | t }}
      </button>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} BLOCKED: aguarda app — Character / Universe. Grouped sections fill here. {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="ap-groupby__panel" data-group-panel="character" hidden>
      <p class="ap-groupby__empty type-caption">{{ 'sections.catalogue.group_empty_character' | t }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ap-groupby__panel" data-group-panel="universe" hidden>
      <p class="ap-groupby__empty type-caption">{{ 'sections.catalogue.group_empty_universe' | t }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="{{ 'line-group-by.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Line — group by",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [],
  "enabled_on": { "templates": ["page"] }
}
{% endschema %}
